            <h1>About Us</h1>
            <div class="textBox">
                <p>Kasper College was established in 1989 to specialize in Computing, Design, and Digital Technologies. Over the past three decades, we have evolved into one of the region's premier technical and creative education hubs. At Kasper College, we are dedicated to providing students with the education, hands-on experience, and industry exposure they need to achieve their career aspirations, equipping them with the knowledge, technical prowess, and creative problem-solving skills required to succeed in a rapidly evolving global market. </p>
                <p>Our close integration with leading technology firms, software houses, creative agencies, and regional enterprises provides students with direct industry pathways, live commercial briefs, and invaluable placement opportunities. Kasper College gives you the definitive edge when entering the professional world.</p>
                <h2>Our mission, vision & core values</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Mission: </b>To empower students from all backgrounds through inspiring teaching, cutting-edge technical facilities, and innovative research in computing, networking, and creative design.</li>
                    <li><b>Vision: </b>To be recognised globally as a benchmark institution where technology meets creativity, preparing ethical, skilled, and visionary digital leaders.</li>
                    <li><b>Innovation & Exploration: </b>We cultivate curiosity, experimentation, and critical thinking across digital and creative domains.</li>
                    <li><b>Industry Relevance: </b>Every course is built in consultation with industry partners to ensure curriculum alignment with modern tech stacks and workplace practices.</li>
                    <li><b>Inclusivity & Community: </b>We champion diversity, accessibility, and mutual support across our vibrant campus.</li>
                </ul>
                <h2>Key Facts & Statistics</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Campus Size: </b>9,500 m² of modern, purpose-built educational space.</li>
                    <li><b>Student Community: </b>Over 1,600 undergraduate and postgraduate students from more than 40 countries.</li>
                    <li><b>Staff & Faculty: </b>240+ dedicated academic faculty, industry-fellow lecturers, and specialized technical support staff.</li>
                    <li><b>Employability Record: </b>96% of graduates are in professional employment or further study within six months of graduation.</li>
                    <li><b>Recent Campus Investment: </b>£4.5 million recently invested in state-of-the-art GPU clusters, cybersecurity cyber ranges, and VR/AR immersive labs.</li>
                </ul>
                <h2>Principal's Welcome</h2>
                <p><b>Dr. Marcus Vance, Principal & CEO:</b> "Welcome to Kasper College. Whether you are stepping into higher education for the first time, advancing your skills through postgraduate study, or collaborating with us as an industry partner, Kasper College offers an exceptional community of passionate educators, researchers, and creators. Our campus in Sheffield has been purposefully designed to foster collaboration between computing specialists and creative designers—mirroring the modern digital economy. We look forward to supporting you on your journey to excellence." </p>
        
            </div>
        
