                <h2>Transport & Travel Guide</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>By Train: </b>Sheffield Central Station is a 12-minute walk from the main entrance, or a 5-minute ride on the Supertram.</li>
                    <li><b>By Supertram: </b>Take the Blue or Yellow route to the 'College Square / Arts Quarter' tram stop located directly opposite the campus plaza.</li>
                    <li><b>By Bus: </b>Major bus routes 51, 52, 120, and X1 terminate or stop directly outside the Main Entrance on Main Street.</li>
                    <li><b>By car: </b>Easily accessible from the M1 Motorway (Junction 33) via the Sheffield Parkway. Note: On-campus parking is strictly reserved for Blue Badge holders and authorized college visitors. Public parking is available at the adjacent City Gateway Multi-Storey Car Park.</li>
                    <li><b>By Bicyle: </b>Located adjacent to National Cycle Route 6. Secure swipe-card indoor bike storage and shower facilities are located on Ground Floor West. </li>
                </ul>
            
